<p>Hey <%= @user.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<p>
  Thanks for subscribing to
  <%= link_to("Dabble Me PRO", entries_url)+"." %>
  The premium features have now been unlocked for your account at <%= @user.email %>.
</p>

<% if @user.frequencies == "Sun" %>
  <p>
    <strong>Your days to receive emails are set to: <%= @user.frequencies %>.</strong>
    If you subscribed to increase the frequency of emails being sent, please make sure to edit your
    <%= link_to("User Settings", settings_url(token: @user.email_settings_token)) %>
    and check the boxes on the days you want to receive emails.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  You'll now have access to:
  <ul>
    <li>
      <%= link_to "Change the frequency", settings_url(token: @user.email_settings_token) %>
      of your emails
    </li>
    <li>Add/edit entries via the web</li>
    <li>Attach photos with your entry (up to <%= CollageGenerator::MAX_IMAGES %> per entry)</li>
    <li>Rich text formatting through the web interface</li>
    <li>
      <%= link_to "Calendar View", entries_calendar_url %>
      of your past entries to know you've written every day
    </li>
    <li>
      <%= link_to "Search", search_url %>
      all of your past entries with support for hashtags
    </li>
    <li>
      <%= link_to "Import", import_url %>
      entries from other services
    </li>
  </ul>
</p>
<%# The TestFlight beta is for PRO only (a purchase in it is free): checked here too, whoever sends this. %>
<% if @user.is_pro? %>
<p style="padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background-color: #F3F2EC;">
  <b>On an iPhone or iPad?</b>
  As a PRO member, you can use the Dabble Me app before it's in the App Store:
  <%= link_to "get the iOS app (beta)", ApplicationHelper.ios_testflight_url, style: "font-weight: bold;" %>.
</p>
<% end %>
<p>
  <br>
  Thanks,
  <br>
  <%= link_to "Paul Arterburn","https://paularterburn.com/" %>
  <br>
  Creator of Dabble Me
  <br>
  For support, email
  <%= mail_to("hello@#{ENV['MAIN_DOMAIN']}", "hello@#{ENV['MAIN_DOMAIN']}") %>
</p>


<p>
  <i>
    P.S. You can
    <%= link_to "manage your subscription", "https://#{ENV['MAIN_DOMAIN']}/billing" %>
    <% if @user.plan_frequency == "Monthly" %>
      to upgrade to the annual plan (with 2 months free) or cancel at anytime.
    <% else %>
      to cancel at anytime.
    <% end %>
  </i>
</p>
